# p5 mcp: c1db919's /mcp menu with the same three servers as
# p5-mcp-menu-new: its sections, each server's details, help, the
# project-trust confirmation, each left with Esc.
# The stdio server is p5-mcp-stdio.ts, which the profile names by `@BUN@` and
# `@SCENARIOS@` (capture.sh writes both in), and xfx is given the same profile.
work p5-mcp-ws
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-profile.json
wait 4
snap startup
key Escape
wait 1
snap dismissed
type /mcp
key Enter
wait 2
snap list
key Down
wait 0.5
snap list-down
key Tab
wait 1
snap tools
key Tab
wait 1
snap resources
key Tab
wait 1
snap prompts
key Tab
wait 1
snap servers
key Enter
wait 1
snap details-1
key Escape
wait 0.5
key Down
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 1
snap details-2
key Escape
wait 0.5
key Down
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 1
snap details-3
key Escape
wait 0.5
type c
wait 0.7
snap info
key Escape
wait 0.5
type x
wait 0.7
snap x-key
key Escape
wait 0.5
type d
wait 0.7
snap d-key
key Escape
wait 0.5
key Escape
# The Escape that closes the menu arms `esc again to clear` for xfx's
# 500 ms (src/tui/gesture.rs CLEAR_WINDOW): `closed` is snapped while it
# is up, by the screen, not at 0.5 s, on its edge (LAUNCH-SETTLE).
until shown esc again to clear
snap closed
snapfull end
home end
